===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{lb|en|British spelling}} Of, relating to, or causing [[anaesthesia]].

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|British spelling}} A [[substance]] that causes [[reversible]] loss of [[sensation]] or loss of [[consciousness]]; used to perform [[surgery]] without [[pain]].

